>>Q000482 043 
44. ur-sag {d}nin-urta maszkim kal-ga-zu-um 
#tr.en: the hero Ninurta is your powerful guard, 
>>Q000482 044 
45. {d}nusku sukkal mah a2-tah inim-ma-zu-um 
